{"id":"d5c3a293-847d-45eb-8e36-aa2ac3fc2463","slug":"ig5500","model":"IG5500","name":"IG5500 压力变送器","shortDescription":"采用扩散硅压力芯体与信号处理电路，测量兼容气体及液体介质的压力。紧凑结构结合可选输出与过程连接，便于水处理、液压设备和工业过程控制中的现场安装。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"industrial","brand":null,"name":"工业测量","description":null,"seo":{"title":"工业测量","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"33d41440-c759-49f8-90bd-34b6cd5f235a","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040851699125.png","mimeType":"image/png","size":328593,"sha256":"c746becf8db6677ba7f20c1ba57229696ee47b035e9b8e09a92e661b92d3b81c","width":894,"height":591,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/c746becf8db6677ba7f20c1b.png","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.705Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":212,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/742e701732a18bc68d06d2a3.webp"},{"width":640,"height":423,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/bcb0d54fc977c2edfe25d6f5.webp"},{"width":894,"height":591,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/6dcb50f0f86d2a52dccece3c.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["zh-CN","de","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆使用介质广泛，可测油、水、糊状物等，具有一定的防腐蚀能力 </p><p>◆线性好，高准确度，高稳定性，寿命长 </p><p>◆体积小，重量轻，方便安装 </p><p>◆范围宽抗腐蚀，适于多种介质</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>水厂、污水处理厂、石油化工、工业过程</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p>测量介质：气体、液体、油等</p><p>测量形式及范围：表压（G）---最大(0～60)MPa, 最小(0～0.5)Kpa</p><p>绝压（A）---最大(0～40)MPa, 最小 (0～5)KPa</p><p>负压（B）--- (-0.1～40)MPa,   最小(-0.2～0.2 )KPa</p><p>环境温度：-10~65℃ </p><p>环境湿度：5~100%相对湿度</p><p>精度等级：0.1%</p><p>过载能力：量程的2～5倍</p><p>长期稳定性：小于0.2%FS/60个月</p><p>供电电源：24VDC</p><p>输出信号：(4～20)mA（二/三线制）（选配HART协议输出）、（0～10/20）mA<br />（0～5）V、（1～5）V、（0～10）V、（选配）RS485</p><p>显示方式：数显                                             </p><p>测量速率：0.2S</p><p>工作温度：-40～80℃</p><p>补偿温度：-20～70 ℃</p><p>过程连接：M20×1.5外螺纹（Ф3内孔），或用户指定</p><p>防护等级：IP67</p><p>电磁兼容:射频保护符合 EN61326</p><br /><p></p>\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"技术参数","specifications":[{"key":"medium","label":"测量介质","value":"气体、液体、油等","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-form","label":"测量形式及范围","value":"表压（G）---最大(0～60)MPa, 最小(0～0.5)Kpa","unit":null},{"key":"operating-temperature","label":"环境温度","value":"-10~65℃; -40～80℃","unit":null},{"key":"operating-humidity","label":"环境湿度","value":"5~100%相对湿度","unit":null},{"key":"accuracy","label":"精度等级","value":"0.1%","unit":null},{"key":"overload-capacity","label":"过载能力","value":"量程的2～5倍","unit":null},{"key":"long-term-stability","label":"长期稳定性","value":"小于0.2%FS/60个月","unit":null},{"key":"power-supply","label":"供电电源","value":"24VDC","unit":null},{"key":"output","label":"输出信号","value":"(4～20)mA（二/三线制）（选配HART协议输出）、（0～10/20）mA","unit":null},{"key":"display","label":"显示方式","value":"数显","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-rate","label":"测量速率","value":"0.2S","unit":null},{"key":"compensation-temperature","label":"补偿温度","value":"-20～70 ℃","unit":null},{"key":"process-connection","label":"过程连接","value":"M20×1.5外螺纹（Ф3内孔），或用户指定","unit":null},{"key":"protection","label":"防护等级","value":"IP67","unit":null},{"key":"emc","label":"电磁兼容","value":"射频保护符合 EN61326","unit":null}]}],"sourceReviews":[],"documents":[],"supportDownloads":[],"seo":{"title":"IG5500 压力变送器 | IGENU SCIENCE","description":"采用扩散硅压力芯体与信号处理电路，测量兼容气体及液体介质的压力。紧凑结构结合可选输出与过程连接，便于水处理、液压设备和工业过程控制中的现场安装。","imageUrl":"/igenu-preview/media/c746becf8db6677ba7f20c1b.png","index":true}}